@prefix mem: <https://w3id.org/dfcm/memory#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .

# Qualification-only cross-pack stubs.
# R73 consumes exact Project-memory record identities owned by the admitted
# temporal-truth-observability-pack. These declarations make the dependency
# explicit for isolated pack qualification without copying the owning pack's
# domain facts or transferring its standing/authority.
mem:frontier a prov:Entity .
mem:ledger a prov:Entity .
mem:portfolio a prov:Entity .
mem:select a prov:Entity .
